                                "sense_id": "ff5791c8-a259-3a09-9862-7124f0d7c7d0",
                                "text": "...expect not so fair an enemy as Cromwel, nor such fair quarter as now is given thee: Jockey, Jemmy, and Moggy thy she-souldier, must than all to the sword..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cab3ff1c-0891-4c02-941d-deebca712944",
                                "sense_id": "ff5791c8-a259-3a09-9862-7124f0d7c7d0",
                                "text": "...in another Hut, a parcel of Scoth Pedlars and their Moggies,\nDancing a Highlanders Jig..."
